  "body": "Bathed in natural light from its sought after corner position, this beautifully presented apartment captures the very essence of effortless lock up and leave living. Elevated on the eighth floor, Apartment 806 enjoys a wonderful north-west aspect, overlooking the inviting 25m pool while taking in ever-changing views across the city skyline and Takapuna central. \r\n\r\nDesigned for both comfort and functionality, the spacious layout features two bedrooms, two bathrooms and the convenience of two secure carparks and storage locker, a combination that is increasingly difficult to achieve.  \r\n\r\nWhether you’re enjoying your morning coffee in the sun, watching the city lights come alive in the evening, or simply appreciating the peace and privacy of this elevated position, this is a home that feels both uplifting and relaxing.\r\n\r\nPhone Alison Parker Resident Sentinel Agent at New Zealand Sotheby's International Realty on 021 983 533 for a viewing today.  \r\n\r\nThe Sentinel has long been recognised as one of Takapuna’s premier apartment addresses, offering residents an exceptional lifestyle with resort-style facilities including a heated swimming pool, spa, sauna, fully equipped gymnasium and the reassurance of a welcoming concierge service. Security, convenience and a genuine sense of community combine to create an environment that owners are proud to call home.\r\n\r\nJust moments from Takapuna Beach, trendy cafes,  restaurants, shopping, Sunday markets and events and excellent transport links, everything you need is within easy reach while you enjoy the peace of a secure, low-maintenance home.\r\n\r\nWhether you’re downsizing, seeking a fabulous new lifestyle,  Apartment 806 offers an outstanding opportunity to secure a light-filled home in one of Auckland’s most desirable coastal locations.\r\n\r\nContact Alison Parker at New Zealand Sotheby's International Realty for more information.",
